### Pick 4 — The Pavé Band White Gold (Best Sparkle)

**Common Prong Diamond Pavé Engagement Ring in 14K White Gold by James Allen**

- Setting price: [$2,090](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/common-prong-diamond-pave-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-310923?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)
- Stone: [1ct D VVS2 Excellent IGI Marquise Lab](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/30016385?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — $657
- **Total ring: $2,747**

[![Common Prong Pavé Marquise Engagement Ring white gold with 1ct D VVS2 lab diamond](/images/marquise-pave-engagement-ring-white-gold-top-view.jpg)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/common-prong-diamond-pave-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-310923?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=Image)

Pavé means tiny diamonds set into the band from the shoulder to the setting. Common prong pavé shares prongs between adjacent stones — it gives maximum coverage with fewer interruptions. The band sparkles the full length of the finger.

On a [marquise diamond ring](/marquise-diamond-ring), the elongated stone plus a sparkly band creates a distinctive finger-coverage effect. The stone elongates. The band extends the sparkle. The combination is unlike any round or cushion setup.

The 1ct D VVS2 at $657 gives you top color and near-top clarity. The total sits at $2,747 — well under the $4,500 ceiling. Major visual impact for the price.

**Who this is for:** You want the ring to sparkle beyond the center stone. You wear other rings alongside it. You want a 1ct marquise that looks like it cost more than it did.

